#==============================================================================================
#
#   dump_2 - Dump: the selector, rule, style sheet and paintable tree dumps
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Dump.cpp (lines 429-770). The paintable tree dump is the
#       second part of a Layout test's expected text (DESIGN.md §6.2). The formatting helpers
#       are dump_1's.
#
#       The selector dump walks CSS::Selector::CompoundSelector and SimpleSelector, which the
#       skeleton keeps opaque until region r38 fills them: dump_selector writes its header and
#       traps on a selector with compound selectors, and dump_qualified_name traps.
#
